  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NCHRD- Kenya</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCHRD-Kenya - NCHRD-Kenya 2021-23 - Core Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The National Coalition of Human Rights Defenders - Kenya (NCHRD eller Defenders Coalition) &#xe4;r en medlemsorganisation etablerad 2007 och registrerad i Kenya som en stiftelse. Defenders Coalition arbetar prim&#xe4;rt med skydd av m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare i Kenya. Bland annat inneb&#xe4;r deras arbete att starka kapaciteten av m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare f&#xf6;r att arbeta mer effektivt, samtidigt som de arbetar med p&#xe5;verkansarbete f&#xf6;r b&#xe4;ttre lagstiftning och institutionell milj&#xf6; f&#xf6;r att minska m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare s&#xe5;rbarhet f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rf&#xf6;ljelse och/eller skada. Ambassaden bidrar med k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Defenders Coalition Strategiska Plan 2022-2025 - Safety. Security. Wellbeing of Rights Defenders.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Coalition of Human Rights Defenders - Kenya (NCHRD or Defenders Coalition) is a national membership organization established in 2007 and registered under Kenyan law as a Trust. The Defenders Coalition works primarily for the protection of Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) in Kenya. Among others, the Defenders Coalition strengthens capacities of HRDs to work more effectively, besides advocating for favorable legal, policy and institutional environments in order to reduce their vulnerability to the risk of persecution and or harm. The Embassy provide core-support to the Defenders Coalition Strategic Plan 2020-2025 - Safety. Security. Wellbeing of Rights Defenders.</narrative>
  </description>
